text NaturePreserveGatehouse_Text_DontHavePokemon
{
    format("Hey! Through here is the Nature Preserve, it's full of wild Pokémon. I don't know where your partner Pokémon is, but for your safety, I can't let you through here without one.")
}

text NaturePreserveGatehouse_Text_EnjoyThePreserve 
{
    format("Through here are the Nature Preserve and the Witherbloom campus. Hope you and your Pokémon enjoy the fresh air!")
}